namespace pdg { /**
\fn pdg::Deserializer::setDataPtr(Uint8Array data)
\brief Initialize a reader from an owned copy of Uint8Array bytes.

Copies only the supplied view's bytes, including when the view is a Node Buffer. The deserializer retains the copy until its input is replaced or the reader is destroyed. Mutating, detaching or collecting the source after this call cannot change the reader. Strings are rejected.
\param data A Uint8Array containing a serialized stream.
\see setDataPtr(MemBlock)
**/ }
